      "message": "rewrite this entire block so that you don\u0027t need extra clones. You could probably do this as a reference too but that might be more difficult.\n\n```\nlet filter \u003d {\n  let mut scanners_lock \u003d self.scanners.lock().unwrap();\n  match Self::find_scanner_by_id(\u0026mut scanners_lock, scanner_id) {\n    None \u003d\u003e {\n      log::warn!(\"Scanner {} not found\", scanner_id);\n      return BtStatus::Fail;\n    }\n    \n    Some(scanner) \u003d\u003e {\n      scanner.is_active \u003d true;\n      if scanner.is_suspended {\n        scanner.filter.clone()\n      } else {\n        filter\n      }\n    }\n  }\n};\n```",
